  anal: ['To do with the anus, the terminal digestive opening.', '肛門的'],
  canal: ['A passage or tunnel through a body structure.', '管；管道'],
  cricoid: ['Ring-shaped; the cricoid cartilage forms the lower laryngeal ring.', '環狀軟骨的；環狀軟骨'],
